          :evidence "Only asl/ and mem/ maintain local memory directories; the remaining 15 sub-repositories lack local mem/ directories, centralizing everything into root .asl/mem/."
          :remediation "Provision localized package-scoped memory directories where domain tasks warrant autonomy, or formally scope D68 to multi-workspace federation.")

