          :evidence "escape-sh-arg is mandated by D34 to reside in asl-text/escape. asl-codec/sh-transpile defines a local duplicate wrapper."
          :remediation "Remove local escape-sh-arg from asl-codec/sh-transpile; import from asl-text/escape.")

